#: modules/health/class-health-module.php:43
msgid "Get WordPress Info"
msgstr ""

#: modules/health/class-health-module.php:44
msgid ""
"Returns WordPress version, site URL, language, timezone, admin email "
"(masked), multisite status and memory limit. No credentials or file paths "
"are exposed."
msgstr ""

#: modules/health/class-health-module.php:87
msgid "Get PHP Version"
msgstr ""

#: modules/health/class-health-module.php:88
msgid ""
"Returns the server PHP version, extensions relevant to WordPress, and "
"whether the version meets current WordPress requirements."
msgstr ""

#: modules/health/class-health-module.php:128
msgid "Get Active Plugins"
msgstr ""

#: modules/health/class-health-module.php:129
msgid ""
"Returns all currently active plugins with name, version, author and update "
"availability. Does not expose file paths or plugin source code."
msgstr ""

#: modules/health/class-health-module.php:175
msgid "Get Active Theme"
msgstr ""

#: modules/health/class-health-module.php:176
msgid ""
"Returns the active theme name, version, author, parent theme (if any) and "
"whether it supports key WordPress features."
msgstr ""

#: modules/health/class-health-module.php:225
msgid "Get Site Health Summary"
msgstr ""

#: modules/health/class-health-module.php:226
msgid ""
"Returns a site health overview: post/page/media counts, WordPress and PHP "
"versions, debug mode status, HTTPS status, and whether automatic updates are "
"enabled."
msgstr ""

#: modules/health/class-health-module.php:273
msgid "Get Permalink Structure"
msgstr ""

#: modules/health/class-health-module.php:274
msgid ""
"Returns the current permalink structure, category and tag base prefixes, and "
"whether pretty permalinks are enabled."
msgstr ""

#: modules/health/class-health-module.php:304
msgid "Get Cron Status"
msgstr ""

#: modules/health/class-health-module.php:305
msgid ""
"Returns the WP-Cron status, whether it is disabled, and the next scheduled "
"events (up to 20). Does not expose cron hook arguments or callback details."
msgstr ""

