#: modules/seo/class-seo-module.php:61
msgid "Get SEO Summary"
msgstr ""

#: modules/seo/class-seo-module.php:62
msgid ""
"Returns an overall SEO health summary: total posts, posts missing meta "
"title, missing meta description, missing featured images, short content, and "
"detected SEO plugin."
msgstr ""

#: modules/seo/class-seo-module.php:99
msgid "Score is an estimate. Use a dedicated SEO tool for accurate audits."
msgstr ""

#: modules/seo/class-seo-module.php:107
msgid "Find Missing Meta Titles"
msgstr ""

#: modules/seo/class-seo-module.php:108
msgid ""
"Returns published posts and pages that do not have a custom SEO meta title "
"set in any supported SEO plugin (Yoast, Rank Math, AIOSEO). Posts without a "
"custom title will use the post title, which may not be optimal for SEO."
msgstr ""

#: modules/seo/class-seo-module.php:129
msgid "Find Missing Meta Descriptions"
msgstr ""

#: modules/seo/class-seo-module.php:130
msgid ""
"Returns published posts and pages that have no meta description set in any "
"supported SEO plugin. Meta descriptions are important for search engine "
"result click-through rates."
msgstr ""

#: modules/seo/class-seo-module.php:207
msgid "Find Posts Without Featured Images"
msgstr ""

#: modules/seo/class-seo-module.php:208
msgid ""
"Returns published posts that have no featured image set. Featured images "
"improve SEO and social sharing appearance."
msgstr ""

#: modules/seo/class-seo-module.php:263
msgid "Analyze Content Structure"
msgstr ""

#: modules/seo/class-seo-module.php:264
msgid ""
"Analyses a single post or page and returns word count, heading structure, "
"internal/external link counts, image count, readability notes and content "
"length assessment."
msgstr ""

#: modules/users/class-users-module.php:47
msgid "List Users"
msgstr ""

#: modules/users/class-users-module.php:48
msgid ""
"Returns a paginated list of registered users. Each entry includes ID, "
"display name, email (masked), role, registration date and post count. No "
"password hashes or session data is included."
msgstr ""

