msgid "Get User"
msgstr ""

#: modules/users/class-users-module.php:111
msgid ""
"Returns profile information for a single user by ID. Includes display name, "
"masked email, role, bio, website and post count. Password and session data "
"are never returned."
msgstr ""

#: modules/users/class-users-module.php:134
msgid "User not found."
msgstr ""

#: modules/users/class-users-module.php:153
msgid "Search Users"
msgstr ""

#: modules/users/class-users-module.php:154
msgid ""
"Searches users by display name, login or email. Returns matching users with "
"ID, display name, masked email and role."
msgstr ""

#: modules/users/class-users-module.php:202
msgid "Get User Roles"
msgstr ""

#: modules/users/class-users-module.php:203
msgid ""
"Returns all registered WordPress user roles with name, slug and capability "
